OL,3,GNEWSALegionnaires' disease concern
OL,4,Ashuts leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leisure centre has been closed with
OL,7,F"immediate effect" following the
OL,8,Fdetection of Legionella bacteria in its
OL,9,Fwater system.
OL,11,FThe States of Guernsey said the Beau
OL,12,FSejour Leisure Centre was being closed
OL,13,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday as a
OL,14,Fprecaution after routine testing found
OL,15,Fthe bacteria, which can occasionally
OL,16,Fcause Legionnaires' disease.
OL,18,FIt said Public Health confirmed there
OL,19,Fwas no known cases of the disease in
OL,20,Fthe community.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
